# Play mode: hardn's own screens and prompts, on the real$
# plan/apply engine against a simulated host, hostfake's$
# recording host.System, whose commands a model of the host$
# answers. Nothing on this machine changes: every command and$
# file is the fake's, and its record is shown when play ends.$
$
# Info: users/alpine-no-rule$
# web-01.example.net runs Alpine 3.23. george is in no doas$
# rule: not in wheel, no file of hardn's. Grant writes hardn's$
# doas file.$
$
# User Management ##############################################$
$
  [ ] User                 Partial non-root, no doas$
$
# george -------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  doas                 Disabled$
   -  SSH Keys             2 keys$
   -  Password             None$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Manage User          Configure doas, SSH keys$
   2) Create User          Configure a new user$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Enter your choice [0-2 or q]: 1$
$
# Manage User ##################################################$
$
  Select a user$
$
   1) george$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Enter your choice [0-1 or q]: 1$
$
# Manage User ##################################################$
$
  Managing: [george]$
$
# User Configuration -------------------------------------------$
$
   -  doas                 Disabled$
   -  SSH Keys             2 keys$
   -  Password             None$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Grant admin rights   Let george become root$
   3) SSH Keys             Add or remove SSH keys$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Enter your choice [0-1, 3 or q]: 1$
$
# Grant admin rights ###########################################$
$
# User Configuration -------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] doas                 Enabled, No password to ask for$
$
   -  Let george use doas$
      /etc/doas.d/zz-hardn-george.conf$
      @@ -0,0 +1,2 @@$
      +# Managed by hardn$
      +permit nopass george$
$
  Grant george admin rights? [y/N, 0 or q]: y$
$
  [+] Let george use doas  Done$
$
# Operation Successful$
$
# Manage User ##################################################$
$
  Managing: [george]$
$
# User Configuration -------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] doas                 Enabled, No password to ask for$
   -  Granted by           hardn$
   -  SSH Keys             2 keys$
   -  Password             None$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Remove admin rights  Take them away$
   2) Ask for password     For admin rights$
   3) SSH Keys             Add or remove SSH keys$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Enter your choice [0-3 or q]: 0$
$
# Manage User ##################################################$
$
  Select a user$
$
   1) george$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Enter your choice [0-1 or q]: 0$
$
# User Management ##############################################$
$
  [+] User                 Configured non-root, doas$
$
# george -------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] doas                 Enabled, No password to ask for$
   -  Granted by           hardn$
   -  SSH Keys             2 keys$
   -  Password             None$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Manage User          Configure doas, SSH keys$
   2) Create User          Configure a new user$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Enter your choice [0-2 or q]: 0$
$
# simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
